=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> made against this creature has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 2: <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Stars\" title=\"Circle of the Stars\">Circle of the Stars</a></li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Circle of the Stars Druids gain 2<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png/30px-Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png/40px-Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Map\" title=\"Star Map\">Star Maps</a> at level 2, as well as an additional Star Map at levels 5 and 9. Star maps are exclusively used to cast Star Map: Guiding Bolt, and can only be obtained through the <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Stars\" title=\"Circle of the Stars\">Circle of the Stars</a> subclass.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034723\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.077 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3082/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 51297/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 19412/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1317333/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n117.76%   77.139     42 Template:Trim\n100.00%   65.506      1 -total\n 98.77%   64.700      1 Template:Feature_page\n 25.30%   16.574      6 Template:Icon_text\n 21.87%   14.323      4 Template:Icon_link\n 17.40%   11.396      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 15.42%   10.100      1 Template:DamageType\n 13.45%    8.812      6 Template:Ifempty\n 13.37%    8.760      1 Template:Condition\n 11.69%    7.659      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:48975-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034723 and revision id 388578. Rende